1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr. Ernst Trier Mørch is my 4th cousin once removed, and a member of the Danish Resistance. He was responsible for tricking the Germans during World War II to help save the Jews.. He created with a pharmacist frien
2 CONC d, a powder of rabbits blood and cocaine to help hide Jewish stowaways aboard boats headed for Sweden. The Danes spread this powder on the boats with Jewish people hidden in the hull of the boat. The powder attracted the dogs to f
2 CONC irst sniff but then it numbed their noses and hindered their ability to find the Jews. It's an amazing story! ~ M. Foss N.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is an obituary published which describes his many achievements: https://www.nytimes.com/1996/01/18/us/ernst-morch-87-an-inventor-and-leading-anesthesiologist.html
