1 NOTE {geni:about_me} OLAF NEUMANN THUNE BEGTRUP grew up in Iowa and graduated from Iowa State University. He was an engineer at Hughes Aircraft for 27 years until he retired. Oley was a longtime member of Woodland Hills United Methodis
