1 NOTE {geni:about_me} LENA MARTHA FEILBERG 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peacefully at the Villa Youville in Ste. Anne, Manitoba, on January 3, 2011, Lena Martha Feilberg, of East Braintree, Manitoba, passed away at the age of 101 years old. She was our beloved Mother, Grandmother, Great-Grandmother an
2 CONC d Aunt. She is lovingly remembered by her son Carl (Lorna) and daughter-in-law Doris; grand-children, Heather (Dean) McDonald, Eric (Julie), Lars (Valerie), Leanne, Caroline, Victoria, Julianna and Kimberly; great-grandchildren, T
2 CONC anner and Reed McDonald, Chelsea, Chloe, Justin (Amanda), Brendan, Lauren, Riley, Kynan, Arius, Mikaius and Christopher, and many nieces and nephews. Lena was predeceased by Haakon, her husband of 71 years; son Dorwin; grandson Er
2 CONC in; siblings Liz, Anna, Emma and Ed; her parents Gotleib and Pauline Marquardt. Cremation has taken place, with interment at a later date. A memorial service will be held at 11:00 a.m., on January 10, 2011, at Birchwood Funeral Ch
2 CONC apel, 150 Penfeld Dr., Steinbach, MB. A reception will follow. In lieu of flowers, donations in memory of Lena may be made to the Villa Youville, 15 Charriere Rd., Ste. Anne, MB, R5H-1C9 or to a charity of your choice. The family 
2 CONC would like to thank home care workers, Jeannette, Julie, Bonnie and Donna, for their care in helping Lena to remain in her own home until her late nineties; the Seine Medical Center, Doctor Lemoine and especially Doctor Doyle, for
2 CONC  his years of support and friendship; the wonderful staff at the Villa Youville, for their love and kindness. Arrangements by Birchwood Funeral Chapel 1-204-346-1030 or 1-888-454-1030
2 CONT
2 CONT As published in the Winnipeg Free Press on January 08, 2011
