1 NOTE {geni:about_me} J. Margaret "Peggy" Begtrup passed away on November 1, 2004. she was born in Oto, Iowa on May 5, 1917. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She graduated from Drake University. Peggy was a schoolteacher and homemaker. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married 63 wonderful years to Olaf "Oley" Begtrup, and was mother of three, and grandmother of five. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peggy was very active in community affairs as a member and officer of Woodland Hills Women's Club for twenty-five years. She was also active in W est Valley Garden Club, Woodland Hills United Mothodist Church, and West Valley Food
2 CONC  Pantry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in the Los Angeles Daily News on 11/2/2004. 
